<section class="prayer-knowledge qibla-guide" id="qibla-guide" aria-labelledby="qibla-guide-heading">
 <header>
  <h2 id="qibla-guide-heading">How to find the Qibla direction accurately</h2>
  <p>The Qibla is the direction Muslims face towards the Sacred Mosque in Makkah when praying. This guide explains how to use the bearing above, locate north without a phone compass, understand magnetic readings and handle unreliable sensors or unfamiliar places.</p>
 </header>
